# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Pages serves 404.html automatically for unknown paths, so nothing here is
# required. What IS worth turning on: forcing one canonical hostname, so Google
# doesn't index the site twice and split its ranking.
#
# After you've added BOTH the apex and www domains to the Pages project
# (Custom domains tab), uncomment ONE of the pairs below and redeploy.

# --- Prefer www ---------------------------------------------------------
# https://example.com.au/*  https://www.example.com.au/:splat  301!

# --- Prefer the bare domain ---------------------------------------------
# https://www.example.com.au/*  https://example.com.au/:splat  301!

# The trailing ! forces the redirect even when a matching file exists.
# Rules are evaluated top to bottom; first match wins. 100 rules max.
